WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.659
Unconditional integer

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:03.569
factorization in subexponential

00:00:03.381 --> 00:00:03.993
time

00:00:04.518 --> 00:00:05.496
The paper gives

00:00:05.308 --> 00:00:06.051
a complete

00:00:06.216 --> 00:00:07.831
unconditional factorization

00:00:07.643 --> 00:00:08.963
method with effectively

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.060
computable constants

00:00:10.131 --> 00:00:11.192
and no unproven

00:00:11.004 --> 00:00:11.841
assumptions

00:00:11.888 --> 00:00:12.926
and every prime

00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:14.093
factor is certified

00:00:13.905 --> 00:00:15.025
deterministically

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:16.634
It also includes

00:00:16.446 --> 00:00:17.955
a complete formalization

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:18.663
in Lean four

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:20.255
using only Mathlib

00:00:20.385 --> 00:00:21.269
to be released

00:00:21.081 --> 00:00:22.059
in a companion

00:00:21.871 --> 00:00:22.696
submission

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:24.224
The paper and

00:00:24.036 --> 00:00:25.474
its formalization were

00:00:25.286 --> 00:00:26.712
obtained by Cogentic

00:00:26.854 --> 00:00:28.304
an agentic framework

00:00:28.116 --> 00:00:29.719
for mathematical discovery

00:00:29.932 --> 00:00:31.323
using Gemini four

00:00:31.135 --> 00:00:31.901
as the base

00:00:31.713 --> 00:00:32.372
model

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:33.924
Full story on

00:00:33.735 --> 00:00:34.631
the dashboard
